# --- EMAIL CONFIGURATION ---
# To send OTPs, you need to use a Gmail account with an App Password.
# 
# STEPS TO GENERATE A GMAIL APP PASSWORD:
# 1. Go to your Google Account (https://myaccount.google.com)
# 2. Click on "Security" on the left navigation panel.
# 3. Ensure "2-Step Verification" is turned ON (required for app passwords).
# 4. Search for "App passwords" in the search bar at the top, or find it under 2-Step Verification.
# 5. Create a new App Password (name it "PoishaGo Backend" or similar).
# 6. Google will generate a 16-character password (e.g., abcd efgh ijkl mnop).
# 7. Copy that 16-character password (without spaces) and paste it below.

GMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password
